usage: textrader [-h] [--version] [--config CONFIG] [--risk RISK]
                 {doctor,market,analyze,paper,backtest,research,llm,connector,kill-switch,ingest,web} ...

TEXTRADER X autonomous trading runtime

positional arguments:
  {doctor,market,analyze,paper,backtest,research,llm,connector,kill-switch,ingest,web}
    doctor              validate runtime/configuration
    market              read real public market data
    analyze             run one XIR decision cycle
    paper               run paper cycles
    backtest            run deterministic historical replay
    research            run auditable knowledge research/search
    llm                 manage/switch the LLM provider (mock, ollama, openai,
                        anthropic, custom)
    connector           manage external source connectors (API key or plain
                        URL)
    kill-switch         activate/resume the safety halt
    ingest              analyze a normalized/manual market JSON snapshot
    web                 start local web dashboard

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --version             show program's version number and exit
  --config CONFIG       trader.yaml path
  --risk RISK           risk.yaml path
